  <section>
    <h2>Behaviour in Amstelvar Avar2</h2>
    <p>
      Amstelvar Avar2 implements XTSP through construction-specific sidebearing
      axes. The drawings remain substantially unchanged; the transformation
      adjusts the space at either side so that each glyph retains an intended
      relationship with neighbouring forms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Straight construction — H</h2>
    <p>
      H is a useful control: its sidebearings become tighter or looser while
      the stems and crossbar stay in place.
    </p>

